stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Revision0: raw input
  Revision0 --> Validated0: schema + semantic
  Validated0 --> RevisionN: ordered Hook rewrite
  RevisionN --> ValidatedN: schema + semantic again
  ValidatedN --> Policy: Hook proposals + policy
  Policy --> Resolver: ask
  Policy --> FinalGate: allow
  Resolver --> FinalGate: explicit allow
  Resolver --> Denied: missing / throw / deny
  FinalGate --> Cancelled: signal aborted
  FinalGate --> Handler: signal live
  Handler --> Post: success / failure
  Post --> Result: continue or stop
